{"title": "Shortened Stride", "pageid": 20022, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shortened_Stride", "categories": ["Bugs", "Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Shortened Stride</b> is a passive feature that shortens a creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">movement speed</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your movement speed is 7.5 m (25 ft). \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Gnome\" title=\"Gnome\">Gnome</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Baff_Elkhorn\" title=\"Baff Elkhorn\">Baff Elkhorn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bala_Ofran\" title=\"Bala Ofran\">Bala Ofran</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Barcus_Wroot\" title=\"Barcus Wroot\">Barcus Wroot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Battrick_Degronce\" title=\"Battrick Degronce\">Battrick Degronce</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bearclaw\" title=\"Bearclaw\">Bearclaw</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Beldron\" title=\"Beldron\">Beldron</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brounce\" title=\"Brounce\">Brounce</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bumpnagel\" title=\"Bumpnagel\">Bumpnagel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Caralee_Grollo\" title=\"Caralee Grollo\">Caralee Grollo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Carys\" title=\"Carys\">Carys</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Civilian_(Gnome,_Iron_Throne)\" title=\"Civilian (Gnome, Iron Throne)\">Civilian (Gnome, Iron Throne)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Deedle_Ofran\" title=\"Deedle Ofran\"